    D -->|Yes| U["REALLOCATE: verified newly unblocked actions"]
    H --> X["RECURSE: repeat first-red census"]
    Q --> X
    U --> X
    X --> M
    C["PCA readiness, not fitted score"] -.-> W
    B["Empirical paired BT, not priority"] -.-> W
    G["Confirmed causal reverse-pressure DAG"] -.-> D

